      "title_zh": "Anthropic 宣布 Claude 平台计算机使用、浏览器工具及多项 API 正式商用",
      "title_orig": "RT ClaudeDevs: Computer use, the browser tool, the Skills API, and the Files API are now generally available on the Claude Platform. Automate work in ...",
